{"module":"evidence","voice":"female","duration":301.5,"segments":[{"el":"title","text":"¿Se acabó el racismo? Lo que muestra la evidencia hoy","start":0.0,"end":3.29,"words":[[0.06,0.2],[0.2,0.54],[0.54,0.68],[0.68,1.23],[1.58,1.72],[1.72,1.85],[1.85,2.34],[2.34,2.47],[2.47,3.09],[3.09,3.23]]},{"el":"intro","text":"Ha habido avances reales: las leyes que nombraban la raza desaparecieron y las actitudes han cambiado.","start":4.09,"end":11.19,"words":[[4.15,4.22],[4.22,4.6],[4.6,5.13],[5.13,5.66],[5.92,6.15],[6.15,6.53],[6.53,6.68],[6.68,7.36],[7.36,7.51],[7.51,7.82],[7.82,8.88],[8.88,8.95],[8.95,9.18],[9.18,9.86],[9.86,10.01],[10.01,10.69]]},{"el":"intro","text":"Pero cuando los investigadores comprueban si todavía se trata distinto a las personas por su raza, manteniendo todo lo demás igual, la respuesta sigue siendo sí.","start":11.54,"end":21.61,"words":[[11.65,11.92],[11.92,12.32],[12.32,12.52],[12.52,13.46],[13.46,14.13],[14.13,14.26],[14.26,14.79],[14.79,14.93],[14.93,15.26],[15.26,15.8],[15.8,15.86],[15.86,16.06],[16.06,16.6],[16.6,16.8],[16.8,16.93],[16.93,17.27],[17.5,18.24],[18.24,18.51],[18.51,18.64],[18.64,18.97],[18.97,19.37],[19.61,19.74],[19.74,20.34],[20.34,20.61],[20.61,21.01],[21.01,21.21]]},{"el":"h0","text":"Vivienda","start":21.96,"end":22.72,"words":[[22.07,22.67]]},{"el":"s0","text":"En un estudio nacional de 2012 para el HUD, evaluadores capacitados que solo se diferenciaban por su raza contactaron a arrendadores y agentes; a los compradores negros se les informó y mostró aproximadamente un 17–18% menos viviendas que a compradores blancos igual de calificados.","start":23.42,"end":43.23,"words":[[23.5,23.64],[23.64,23.79],[23.79,24.28],[24.28,24.85],[24.85,24.99],[24.99,25.7],[25.7,25.98],[25.98,26.12],[26.12,26.34],[26.58,27.36],[27.36,28.14],[28.14,28.28],[28.28,28.57],[28.57,28.71],[28.71,29.63],[29.63,29.84],[29.84,29.98],[29.98,30.27],[30.27,31.04],[31.04,31.11],[31.11,31.89],[31.89,31.96],[31.96,32.53],[32.78,32.85],[32.85,33.06],[33.06,33.84],[33.84,34.27],[34.27,34.41],[34.41,34.62],[34.62,35.12],[35.12,35.19],[35.19,35.61],[35.61,36.74],[36.74,36.89],[36.89,39.01],[39.01,39.36],[39.36,40.0],[40.0,40.14],[40.14,40.21],[40.21,40.99],[40.99,41.49],[41.49,41.84],[41.84,41.98],[41.98,42.83]]},{"el":"s0","text":"Una investigación encubierta de Newsday en 2019 en Long Island halló que los evaluadores negros recibieron trato desigual en el 49% de las pruebas.","start":43.58,"end":54.49,"words":[[43.66,43.86],[43.86,44.75],[44.75,45.43],[45.43,45.57],[45.57,46.05],[46.05,46.19],[46.19,47.28],[47.28,47.41],[47.41,47.62],[47.62,48.03],[48.03,48.3],[48.3,48.44],[48.44,48.64],[48.64,49.39],[49.39,49.8],[49.8,50.49],[50.49,50.83],[50.83,51.37],[51.37,51.51],[51.51,51.65],[51.65,53.22],[53.22,53.35],[53.35,53.56],[53.56,54.1]]},{"el":"h1","text":"Préstamos y tasaciones","start":55.39,"end":57.02,"words":[[55.46,56.13],[56.13,56.21],[56.21,56.95]]},{"el":"s1","text":"Un estudio de millones de hipotecas (Bartlett y otros, 2022) halló que los prestatarios negros y latinos pagaban tasas de interés más altas que prestatarios blancos comparables, incluso con prestamistas algorítmicos.","start":57.72,"end":71.67,"words":[[57.82,57.95],[57.95,58.42],[58.42,58.55],[58.55,59.09],[59.09,59.22],[59.22,59.75],[59.75,60.29],[60.29,60.36],[60.36,60.76],[60.99,61.99],[62.23,62.49],[62.49,62.63],[62.63,62.83],[62.83,63.63],[63.63,64.03],[64.03,64.09],[64.09,64.56],[64.56,65.03],[65.03,65.36],[65.36,65.5],[65.5,65.96],[65.96,66.16],[66.16,66.5],[66.5,66.63],[66.63,67.43],[67.43,67.9],[67.9,68.7],[68.94,69.4],[69.4,69.6],[69.6,70.4],[70.4,71.27]]},{"el":"s1","text":"Las viviendas en barrios mayoritariamente negros se valoran unos $48,000 menos que viviendas similares en otras zonas (Brookings, 2018).","start":72.02,"end":82.77,"words":[[72.12,72.32],[72.32,72.91],[72.91,73.04],[73.04,73.49],[73.49,74.54],[74.54,74.93],[74.93,75.06],[75.06,75.51],[75.51,75.77],[75.77,78.06],[78.06,78.38],[78.38,78.51],[78.51,79.1],[79.1,79.69],[79.69,79.82],[79.82,80.14],[80.14,80.47],[80.47,81.06],[81.28,82.39]]},{"el":"s1","text":"En 2020, una pareja negra de Marin City, California, consiguió una tasación unos $500,000 más alta después de quitar las fotos familiares y pedir a un amigo blanco que se hiciera pasar por el dueño; su demanda se resolvió en 2023.","start":83.12,"end":101.18,"words":[[83.2,83.35],[83.35,84.29],[84.55,84.77],[84.77,85.2],[85.2,85.56],[85.56,85.71],[85.71,86.07],[86.07,86.44],[86.69,87.49],[87.74,88.32],[88.32,88.54],[88.54,89.12],[89.12,89.41],[89.41,91.59],[91.59,91.81],[91.81,92.1],[92.1,92.61],[92.61,92.75],[92.75,93.12],[93.12,93.34],[93.34,93.7],[93.7,94.43],[94.43,94.5],[94.5,94.86],[94.86,94.93],[94.93,95.08],[95.08,95.44],[95.44,95.88],[95.88,96.02],[96.02,96.17],[96.17,96.6],[96.6,96.97],[96.97,97.19],[97.19,97.33],[97.33,97.77],[98.02,98.17],[98.17,98.67],[98.67,98.82],[98.82,99.4],[99.4,99.55],[99.55,100.78]]},{"el":"h2","text":"Policía y tribunales","start":102.08,"end":103.66,"words":[[102.22,102.8],[102.8,102.87],[102.87,103.6]]},{"el":"s2","text":"El Stanford Open Policing Project analizó casi 100 millones de paradas de tráfico (2020): a los conductores negros los detenían con más frecuencia, la proporción de conductores negros detenidos bajaba de noche, cuando es más difícil ver la raza, y a los conductores negros e hispanos los registraban con menos evidencia.","start":104.36,"end":125.75,"words":[[104.47,104.61],[104.61,105.19],[105.19,105.47],[105.47,105.98],[105.98,106.48],[106.48,106.99],[106.99,107.27],[107.27,107.56],[107.56,108.14],[108.14,108.28],[108.28,108.79],[108.79,108.93],[108.93,109.44],[109.44,110.37],[110.62,110.7],[110.7,110.91],[110.91,111.7],[111.7,112.14],[112.14,112.35],[112.35,113.0],[113.0,113.22],[113.22,113.43],[113.43,114.22],[114.48,114.62],[114.62,115.34],[115.34,115.48],[115.48,116.28],[116.28,116.71],[116.71,117.36],[117.36,117.79],[117.79,117.93],[117.93,118.36],[118.62,119.05],[119.05,119.19],[119.19,119.41],[119.41,119.91],[119.91,120.13],[120.13,120.27],[120.27,120.63],[120.88,120.96],[120.96,121.03],[121.03,121.24],[121.24,122.04],[122.04,122.47],[122.47,122.54],[122.54,123.04],[123.04,123.26],[123.26,124.05],[124.05,124.27],[124.27,124.63],[124.63,125.35]]},{"el":"s2","text":"La Comisión de Sentencias de EE. UU. halló en 2017 que los hombres negros recibían condenas federales un 19% más largas que hombres blancos en situación similar.","start":126.1,"end":138.04,"words":[[126.19,126.33],[126.33,126.87],[126.87,127.01],[127.01,127.68],[127.68,127.82],[127.82,128.02],[128.36,128.56],[128.9,129.17],[129.17,129.31],[129.31,130.39],[130.39,130.53],[130.53,130.73],[130.73,131.14],[131.14,131.54],[131.54,132.15],[132.15,132.7],[132.7,133.3],[133.3,133.44],[133.44,134.73],[134.73,134.93],[134.93,135.34],[135.34,135.47],[135.47,135.88],[135.88,136.35],[136.35,136.49],[136.49,137.1],[137.1,137.64]]},{"el":"s2","text":"En Flowers v. Mississippi (2019), la Corte Suprema anuló una condena después de que un fiscal excluyera a 41 de 42 posibles jurados negros a lo largo de seis juicios.","start":138.39,"end":150.54,"words":[[138.45,138.58],[138.58,139.04],[139.04,139.24],[139.57,140.3],[140.3,141.42],[141.65,141.78],[141.78,142.11],[142.11,142.58],[142.58,142.91],[142.91,143.1],[143.1,143.57],[143.57,144.03],[144.03,144.16],[144.16,144.29],[144.29,144.43],[144.43,144.82],[144.82,145.48],[145.48,145.55],[145.55,146.41],[146.41,146.54],[146.54,147.33],[147.33,147.86],[147.86,148.32],[148.32,148.72],[148.72,148.78],[148.78,148.92],[148.92,149.25],[149.25,149.38],[149.38,149.64],[149.64,150.17]]},{"el":"h3","text":"Medicina y algoritmos","start":151.44,"end":153.19,"words":[[151.56,152.22],[152.22,152.31],[152.31,153.13]]},{"el":"s3","text":"Un estudio de 2019 en Science halló que un algoritmo muy usado para decidir qué pacientes reciben atención adicional subestimaba lo enfermos que estaban los pacientes negros, porque usaba el gasto médico pasado como sustituto de la necesidad.","start":153.89,"end":168.83,"words":[[154.0,154.13],[154.13,154.6],[154.6,154.74],[154.74,155.81],[155.81,155.95],[155.95,156.35],[156.35,156.62],[156.62,156.76],[156.76,156.89],[156.89,157.5],[157.5,157.7],[157.7,158.04],[158.04,158.31],[158.31,158.78],[158.78,158.91],[158.91,159.52],[159.52,159.99],[159.99,160.53],[160.53,161.14],[161.14,161.88],[161.88,162.01],[162.01,162.55],[162.55,162.69],[162.69,163.16],[163.16,163.36],[163.36,163.97],[163.97,164.44],[164.67,165.01],[165.01,165.35],[165.35,165.48],[165.48,165.82],[165.82,166.22],[166.22,166.63],[166.63,166.9],[166.9,167.5],[167.5,167.64],[167.64,167.77],[167.77,168.45]]},{"el":"s3","text":"Corregirlo duplicaría con creces el número de pacientes negros señalados para recibir ayuda.","start":169.18,"end":174.74,"words":[[169.29,169.86],[169.86,170.56],[170.56,170.75],[170.75,171.13],[171.13,171.25],[171.25,171.63],[171.63,171.76],[171.76,172.33],[172.33,172.71],[172.71,173.28],[173.28,173.53],[173.53,173.98],[173.98,174.36]]},{"el":"s3","text":"(Ver también “Salud” sobre el dolor y los oxímetros de pulso.)","start":175.09,"end":179.09,"words":[[175.18,175.4],[175.4,175.91],[175.91,176.28],[176.28,176.65],[176.65,176.8],[176.8,177.17],[177.17,177.24],[177.24,177.46],[177.46,178.19],[178.19,178.34],[178.34,178.78]]},{"el":"h4","text":"Niños y familias","start":179.99,"end":181.31,"words":[[180.08,180.49],[180.49,180.58],[180.58,181.23]]},{"el":"s4","text":"Un estudio de 2017 estimó que más de la mitad de los niños negros (53%) pasan por una investigación de los servicios de protección infantil antes de los 18 años, frente al 37% de todos los niños.","start":182.01,"end":197.39,"words":[[182.11,182.24],[182.24,182.71],[182.71,182.84],[182.84,183.92],[183.92,184.32],[184.32,184.45],[184.45,184.66],[184.66,184.79],[184.79,184.92],[184.92,185.26],[185.26,185.39],[185.39,185.59],[185.59,185.93],[185.93,186.33],[186.33,187.87],[188.11,188.45],[188.45,188.65],[188.65,188.85],[188.85,189.72],[189.72,189.85],[189.85,190.05],[190.05,190.66],[190.66,190.79],[190.79,191.46],[191.46,192.0],[192.0,192.34],[192.34,192.47],[192.47,192.67],[192.67,193.34],[193.34,193.68],[193.91,194.31],[194.31,194.45],[194.45,195.92],[195.92,196.06],[196.06,196.39],[196.39,196.59],[196.59,197.0]]},{"el":"s4","text":"Los estudiantes negros son suspendidos a tasas mucho más altas que los blancos por conductas similares, según los datos federales de derechos civiles.","start":197.74,"end":207.92,"words":[[197.85,198.07],[198.07,198.89],[198.89,199.33],[199.33,199.55],[199.55,200.37],[200.37,200.44],[200.44,200.81],[200.81,201.18],[201.18,201.4],[201.4,201.77],[201.77,201.92],[201.92,202.14],[202.14,202.66],[202.66,202.88],[202.88,203.55],[203.55,204.29],[204.55,204.92],[204.92,205.14],[205.14,205.51],[205.51,206.18],[206.18,206.32],[206.32,206.92],[206.92,207.51]]},{"el":"h5","text":"La vida cotidiana","start":208.82,"end":210.13,"words":[[208.99,209.14],[209.14,209.43],[209.43,210.08]]},{"el":"s5","text":"En Airbnb, los huéspedes con nombres claramente negros tenían alrededor de un 16% menos de probabilidades de ser aceptados que huéspedes idénticos con nombres que suenan blancos (2017).","start":210.83,"end":223.87,"words":[[210.94,211.08],[211.08,211.56],[211.8,212.0],[212.0,212.55],[212.55,212.75],[212.75,213.23],[213.23,213.91],[213.91,214.32],[214.32,214.8],[214.8,215.41],[215.41,215.55],[215.55,215.69],[215.69,216.91],[216.91,217.25],[217.25,217.39],[217.39,218.35],[218.35,218.48],[218.48,218.69],[218.69,219.3],[219.3,219.44],[219.44,219.98],[219.98,220.6],[220.6,220.8],[220.8,221.28],[221.28,221.42],[221.42,221.83],[221.83,222.3],[222.3,223.46]]},{"el":"s5","text":"El prejuicio antinegro es el motivo más común de los crímenes de odio reportados al FBI cada año.","start":224.22,"end":231.11,"words":[[224.31,224.47],[224.47,225.16],[225.16,225.85],[225.85,226.0],[226.0,226.15],[226.15,226.61],[226.61,226.84],[226.84,227.23],[227.23,227.38],[227.38,227.61],[227.61,228.23],[228.23,228.38],[228.38,228.69],[228.69,229.45],[229.45,229.61],[229.61,230.07],[230.07,230.38],[230.38,230.68]]},{"el":"s5","text":"Y los propios datos de este sitio muestran qué rara vez las llamadas al 911 por “persona sospechosa” encuentran un delito.","start":231.46,"end":239.56,"words":[[231.54,231.61],[231.61,231.81],[231.81,232.3],[232.3,232.65],[232.65,232.78],[232.78,233.06],[233.06,233.41],[233.41,233.96],[233.96,234.1],[234.1,234.38],[234.38,234.59],[234.59,234.79],[234.79,235.28],[235.28,235.42],[235.42,236.46],[236.46,236.67],[236.67,237.15],[237.15,237.84],[237.84,238.54],[238.54,238.68],[238.68,239.16]]},{"el":"h6","text":"Cómo hablar con alguien que cree que el racismo terminó","start":240.46,"end":243.77,"words":[[240.57,240.87],[240.87,241.24],[241.24,241.47],[241.47,241.91],[241.91,242.06],[242.06,242.36],[242.36,242.51],[242.51,242.66],[242.66,243.18],[243.18,243.7]]},{"el":"s6","text":"Pónganse de acuerdo en lo que es cierto.","start":244.47,"end":246.77,"words":[[244.59,245.04],[245.04,245.16],[245.16,245.56],[245.56,245.67],[245.67,245.78],[245.78,245.9],[245.9,246.01],[246.01,246.41]]},{"el":"s6","text":"Mucho ha cambiado; dilo.","start":247.12,"end":249.37,"words":[[247.18,247.55],[247.55,247.63],[247.63,248.31],[248.57,248.95]]},{"el":"s6","text":"La pregunta no es si las cosas están mejor, sino si todavía se trata distinto a las personas.","start":249.72,"end":255.36,"words":[[249.82,249.95],[249.95,250.46],[250.46,250.59],[250.59,250.72],[250.72,250.85],[250.85,251.04],[251.04,251.36],[251.36,251.68],[251.68,252.07],[252.29,252.55],[252.55,252.68],[252.68,253.19],[253.19,253.32],[253.32,253.64],[253.64,254.15],[254.15,254.22],[254.22,254.41],[254.41,254.99]]},{"el":"s6","text":"Empieza con experimentos, no con anécdotas.","start":255.71,"end":258.82,"words":[[255.8,256.24],[256.24,256.43],[256.43,257.31],[257.53,257.66],[257.66,257.84],[257.84,258.47]]},{"el":"s6","text":"Los estudios de auditoría cambian solo la raza.","start":259.17,"end":262.68,"words":[[259.31,259.53],[259.53,260.1],[260.1,260.24],[260.24,260.96],[260.96,261.46],[261.46,261.75],[261.75,261.89],[261.89,262.25]]},{"el":"s6","text":"Pregunta: “Si los currículums eran idénticos, ¿qué explica la diferencia?”","start":263.03,"end":268.53,"words":[[263.13,263.79],[264.05,264.2],[264.2,264.42],[264.42,265.16],[265.16,265.45],[265.45,266.19],[266.45,266.59],[266.59,267.18],[267.18,267.33],[267.33,268.14]]},{"el":"s6","text":"Invita a comprobarlo.","start":268.88,"end":270.4,"words":[[268.96,269.3],[269.3,269.36],[269.36,270.03]]},{"el":"s6","text":"Cada afirmación aquí está etiquetada y tiene fuente.","start":270.75,"end":274.3,"words":[[270.82,271.11],[271.11,271.82],[271.82,272.03],[272.03,272.31],[272.31,272.95],[272.95,273.02],[273.02,273.38],[273.38,273.87]]},{"el":"s6","text":"El escepticismo está bien; aplícalo a la evidencia.","start":274.65,"end":278.02,"words":[[274.75,274.87],[274.87,275.56],[275.56,275.82],[275.82,276.13],[276.35,276.85],[276.85,276.92],[276.92,277.04],[277.04,277.67]]},{"el":"s6","text":"Comparte una historia, con permiso.","start":278.37,"end":281.25,"words":[[278.46,279.03],[279.03,279.25],[279.25,279.81],[280.06,280.27],[280.27,280.84]]},{"el":"s6","text":"Una persona que conocen importa más que una estadística.","start":281.6,"end":285.54,"words":[[281.68,281.91],[281.91,282.43],[282.43,282.58],[282.58,283.1],[283.1,283.62],[283.62,283.84],[283.84,283.99],[283.99,284.22],[284.22,285.11]]},{"el":"s6","text":"No avergüences.","start":285.89,"end":287.02,"words":[[285.99,286.09],[286.09,286.72]]},{"el":"s6","text":"La gente se defiende cuando se siente acusada.","start":287.37,"end":290.11,"words":[[287.51,287.62],[287.62,287.91],[287.91,288.02],[288.02,288.48],[288.48,288.82],[288.82,288.94],[288.94,289.28],[289.28,289.74]]},{"el":"s6","text":"Habla de sistemas, no de su carácter.","start":290.46,"end":293.2,"words":[[290.54,290.8],[290.8,290.93],[290.93,291.52],[291.75,291.88],[291.88,292.01],[292.01,292.14],[292.14,292.73]]},{"el":"s6","text":"Dales algo que hacer.","start":293.55,"end":295.26,"words":[[293.67,294.03],[294.03,294.32],[294.32,294.47],[294.47,294.84]]},{"el":"s6","text":"Una acción pequeña, como leer un módulo, mantiene la puerta abierta.","start":295.61,"end":300.61,"words":[[295.68,295.89],[295.89,296.31],[296.31,296.81],[297.05,297.33],[297.33,297.61],[297.61,297.75],[297.75,298.24],[298.49,299.05],[299.05,299.19],[299.19,299.61],[299.61,300.17]]}]}